# This project installs with npm (see package-lock.json).
#
# A previous `onlyBuiltDependencies: [esbuild]` entry was pnpm-specific syntax and made npm
# print "Unknown project config" warnings on every command. npm already runs dependency build
# scripts (including esbuild's) by default, so no allowlist is needed here. If this repo ever
# adopts pnpm, restore that key in a pnpm-aware config instead.
